<H5> UPDATES</H5><P>

°) this smells like internally causing a recursive data structure<P>

²) OK I got it [HTTPs://perldoc.perl.org/perltie#The-untie-Gotcha,] untie is normally supposed to trigger DESTROY, but inf there are still other refs to the <U>underlying</U> $object
DESTROY can't be triggered. In my case it's actually better not to trigger DESTROY and better to silence the warning altogether.<!-- Wiki2Monks {"version":1.161} -->
